{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dearest Marie,\n\nI arrived in Koblenz safely, though the journey from Kassel was a long one. I spent a pleasant afternoon with the Schulz family in Wetzlar; they are a good, quiet sort, and I enjoyed their company before catching the mail coach at ten. The heat has been oppressive, but I took a bath this morning which did wonders for my spirits.\n\nI miss our home, the library, and the sound of the boys’ voices. I have been thinking of you constantly. The Rhine here is magnificent, but it lacks the warmth of our hearth. I shall continue on to the next stage tomorrow, but I hope to be back in Berlin before the autumn sets in. Give my love to Karl, Immanuel, and Ludwig.\n\nYour affectionate,\nGeorg"}}],"created":1795080655,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":169,"prompt_tokens":953,"total_tokens":1122,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-ODotnugtz2uaBuhBC3X55GFleGmbwijt","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":953,"prompt_ms":901.675,"prompt_per_token_ms":0.9461437565582371,"prompt_per_second":1056.9218399090582,"predicted_n":169,"predicted_ms":3998.569,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.80100595238095,"predicted_per_second":42.015030877296354}}